  <Properties>
    <Name>Jarcast's Bigger Huge Map for Communitu_79a</Name>
    <Stability>Beta</Stability>
    <Teaser>Fork of the Communitu_79a v3.1.0 mapscript with an option for larger Huge map.</Teaser>
    <Description>Fork of the Communitu_79a v3.1.0 mapscript with an additional option for larger Huge maps.
[NEWLINE]5 selectable sizes:
[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Normal Huge (97x66)
[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Huge x1.25 (109x74)
[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Huge x1.5 (119x81)
[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Huge x2 (138x93)
[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Giant Earth-like (160x108)</Description>
    <Authors>Jarcast</Authors>
    <HideSetupGame>0</HideSetupGame>
    <AffectsSavedGames>1</AffectsSavedGames>
